WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From Side Plank on the right hand, step the left foot behind you.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Press into the right hand and lift the hips high.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Reach the left arm overhead and back, opening the chest.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Gaze softens toward the top hand; keep the supporting shoulder stable.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then return to Side Plank and switch sides.
